  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\alpha, \\beta$ be the roots of the equation $x^{2}-6 x-2=0$ with $\\alpha>\\beta$. If $a_{n}=\\alpha^{n}-\\beta^{n}$ for $n \\geq 1$, then the value of $\\frac{a_{10}-2 a_{8}}{2 a_{9}}$ is",
